    "grade": "PASS",
    "ledger": [
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OlmoEarth v1.3: State-of-the-art embeddings for the whole planet",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re releasing OlmoEarth v1.3 , a state-of-the-art satellite embedding model.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Alongside OlmoEarth v1.3, we’re sharing precomputed, annual embeddings for the whole planet (10m, 64- and 128-dimensions), plus a new browser-based tool to explore and customize maps based on those embeddings — the OlmoEarth Embeddings Explorer .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This means anyone can put OlmoEarth v1.3 to work right away, from tracking change over time to finding similar places—no sign-in, and no advanced technical knowledge required.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With OlmoEarth v1.3, we’re excited to give users more ways to explore and engage with planetary artifacts in whatever way suits them best.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OlmoEarth v1.3 reads a year of radar (Sentinel-1) and multispectral (Sentinel-2 and Landsat) satellite time series and produces one 128-dimensional vector for every 10-meter pixel on Earth; the first 64 dimensions also work on their own as a smaller embedding.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "How OlmoEarth v1.3 makes an embedding: a vision transformer reads the satellite data, an Attention Pooler pools it into one vector per patch of land, and a linear layer reduces it to 128 numbers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We evaluated OlmoEarth v1.3's embeddings against AlphaEarth Foundations (AEF) and Tessera v2 across 27 evaluations, covering six continents and many different tasks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OlmoEarth’s 128-dimensional embeddings score highest on 20 of 27 evals and rank highest overall.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Compared to previous generations of OlmoEarth models, OlmoEarth v1.3 was also our cheapest model to train.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "If you wanted to reproduce it, pre-training OlmoEarth v1.3 Base would cost roughly $2,720 of rented H100 time for the final run.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This release includes the OlmoEarth v1.3 Base model, the precomputed global embeddings, the OlmoEarth Embeddings Explorer, and the technical report.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/allenai/olmoearth-v1-3",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T16:11:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:29.688Z"
      }
    ],
